SDL-E1045 (spec/table.md)

  x `$auth.id = id` is not a table permission — write `none`, `full`, or a per-operation block
   ,----
 1 | table t { permissions: $auth.id = id; };
   :                     ^^^^^^^|^^^^^^^
   :                            `-- not the `none | full` shorthand
   `----
  help: table permissions take `permissions: none;`, `permissions: full;`, or a per-operation `permissions { select: …; … };` block — no expression
